sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor C as Customer
  participant R as ROLLER
  participant P as PATCH
  participant A as Loyalty App API
  participant DB as Loyalty App Database
  participant V as Loyalty Web View

  R->>P: Automation sync: Send purchase or booking change for loyalty calculation
  P->>P: Stamp update: Add stamps from the booking quantity (including large purchases)
  P->>P: Reward check: Calculate how many reward thresholds were crossed

  alt One or more rewards unlocked
    loop For each unlocked reward
      P->>P: Code generation: Create unique one-time free-pass code
      P->>P: Contact update: Append new code to contact code field array
      P->>R: Code registration: Register code in ROLLER without customer ownership
    end
    P-->>A: Reward update: POST /webhooks/patch/reward-code
    A->>DB: Code save: Store active code list for this loyalty account
  end

  C->>V: View action: Open loyalty page
  V->>A: Account request: GET /account
  A->>DB: Account read: Load loyalty status and active code list
  A-->>V: Account response: Return loyalty status and available code list
  V-->>C: Customer view: Show loyalty status and available free-pass codes

  C->>R: Checkout action: Apply a free-pass code
  R->>R: Validation rule: Verify code is active and unused
  R->>R: One-time rule: Invalidate code after successful use
  R-->>C: Checkout result: Apply 100% discount when valid

  Note over R,P: ROLLER does not notify PATCH when a code is used.

  loop Scheduled verification automation
    P->>R: Usage check: Query ROLLER Data API checkout data for used codes
    R-->>P: Usage result: Return code usage status snapshot
    P->>P: Contact update: Mark used codes in contact data
    P-->>A: Status update: POST /webhooks/patch/contact-updated
    A->>DB: Used-code save: Add used codes to invalidation list
  end

  alt Booking is canceled or edited later
    R->>P: Automation sync: Send cancellation or edit change
    P->>P: Loyalty correction: Recalculate loyalty counter and reward state
    P-->>A: Loyalty correction: POST /webhooks/patch/contact-updated
    A->>DB: State correction: Save corrected loyalty and code state
  end

  C->>V: Refresh action: Refresh loyalty page
  V->>A: Account request: GET /account
  A->>DB: Account read: Load latest loyalty and used-code state
  A-->>V: Account response: Return updated loyalty and code status
  V-->>C: Customer view: Show latest rewards and used-code status
